<div class="my-4" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-md:18:74"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:13:66">
										<strong>Donor Advised Funds</strong>
									</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:14:20">Create a gift through your Donor Advised Fund.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:15:2">You can also schedule a recurring gift through your DAF.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:16:95">
