<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:25:40-1:2 Columns - Equal:1">
<img width="169" height="142" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/151053b1-29a3-4663-ba2b-3e7ffbdec29d_donate+goods+and+clothing.png" alt="placeholder" / data-zesty-id="content:images:19:69">
<div class="my-4" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-md:24:22"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:20:74"><strong>Shop and Donate</strong></p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:21:91">Your donations to The Salvation Army Family thrift stores help fund life-saving programs in the community.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:22:34">
