<div class="my-4" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-md:37:79"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:33:36"><strong>Planned Giving, Wills, </strong><strong>and Gift Annuities</strong><strong></strong></p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:34:84">When you consider a will or estate gift to The Salvation Army, you leave a legacy of love for those who need it.&nbsp;</p>
